    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d42">

                <pb facs="0111" n="31" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg31"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Campos
                            Sables to the Vice-President of the United
                            States.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I desire to extend to your excellency expression of my profound sorrow at the
                    loss which the American nation has just suffered in the death of its First
                    Magistrate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Ferraz de Campos Salles</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">President of the United States of
                        Brazil.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
